# Legacy dataset generation

## Description

Scripts for generating subset of data in the `legacy_dataset` provided for workshop exercises.

## Generated files

###  palmer_penguins.csv

File contains data about penguins for data exploration tasks. It is derived from a common
example dataset, [Palmer's Penguins](https://allisonhorst.github.io/palmerpenguins/), which contains data of 344 penguins of
various species on several polar islands. 

Modified version stored in /data/legacy_dataset/penguins/palmer_penguins.csv

Modified version is created from a subset of data from palmerpenguins package in Python
Latest version generated 28 July 2026

Acronyms in modified version:
A/Ade - Adelei
C, Chin' - Chinstrap
G, Gen - Gentoo
T/Tor - Torgersen
D/Dre - Dream
B - Biscoe
m - male
f - female

9 sometimes short for 2009

